      "writtenOn": "2024-01-08T11:12:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should we use `saved_usb_conn_status[i] \u003d\u003d USB2_CONNECTED` to ensure a consistent regulator field update behavior across suspend/resume?\n\ni.e. if this stays unchanged, the field will still get unbalanced update on resume for USB3 connection (precisely, as well as `UNKNOWN` state), which may or may not trigger undesired mux update events.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 257,
        "startChar": 31,
        "endLine": 257,
        "endChar": 43
      },
      "revId": "e7d645150409deb5f1eca482ce1815fb166fe38e",
